  <h2>Welcome to College of Engineering Perumon</h2>
  <p>
    College of Engineering Perumon is a government-controlled engineering college established in 2000 under the Co-operative Academy of Professional Education (CAPE), affiliated to APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University and approved by AICTE. The college is known for its commitment to quality education and student excellence.
  </p>

  <h3>Departments:</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Computer Science and Engineering (CSE)</li>
    <li>Electronics and Communication Engineering (ECE)</li>
    <li>Electrical and Electronics Engineering (EEE)</li>
    <li>Mechanical Engineering (ME)</li>
  </ul>

